{"speciesId":59,"names":{"fr":"Arcanin","es":"Arcanine","en":"Arcanine","ja":"ウインディ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"red","text":"A POKéMON that has been admired since the past for its beauty. It runs agilely as if on wings."},{"language":"en","version":"blue","text":"A POKéMON that has been admired since the past for its beauty. It runs agilely as if on wings."},{"language":"en","version":"yellow","text":"A legendary POKé­ MON in China. Many people are charmed by its grace and beauty while running."},{"language":"en","version":"gold","text":"This legendary Chinese POKEMON is considered magnif­ icent. Many people are enchanted by its grand mane."},{"language":"en","version":"silver","text":"Its magnificent bark conveys a sense of majesty. Anyone hearing it can't help but grovel before it."},{"language":"en","version":"crystal","text":"An ancient picture scroll shows that people were attracted to its movement as it ran through prairies."},{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"ARCANINE is known for its high speed. It is said to be capable of running over 6,200 miles in a single day and night. The fire that blazes wildly within this POKéMON’s body is its source of power."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"ARCANINE is known for its high speed. It is said to be capable of running over 6,200 miles in a single day and night. The fire that blazes wildly within this POKéMON’s body is its source of power."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"This fleet-footed POKéMON is said to run over 6,200 miles in a single day and night. The fire that blazes wildly within its body is its source of power."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"A POKéMON that is described in Chinese legends. It is said to race at an unbelievable speed."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"A POKéMON that has long been admired for its beauty. It runs agilely as if on wings."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"Its proud and regal appearance has captured the hearts of people since long ago."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"Its proud and regal appearance has captured the hearts of people since long ago."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"Its proud and regal appearance has captured the hearts of people since long ago."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"This legendary Chinese Pokémon is considered magnificent. Many people are enchanted by its grand mane."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"Its magnificent bark conveys a sense of majesty. Anyone hearing it can’t help but grovel before it."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Son port altier et son attitude fière ont depuis longtemps conquis le cœur des hommes."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"Its proud and regal appearance has captured the hearts of people since long ago."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Son port altier et son attitude fière ont depuis longtemps conquis le cœur des hommes."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"Its proud and regal appearance has captured the hearts of people since long ago."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"The sight of it running over 6,200 miles in a single day and night has captivated many people."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"The sight of it running over 6,200 miles in a single day and night has captivated many people."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Un Pokémon très recherché pour sa grâce légendaire. Il court avec tellement d’agilité qu’on dirait qu’il vole."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Un Pokémon muy admirado desde la antigüedad por su belleza. Corre ágilmente como si tuviera alas."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"A Pokémon that has long been admired for its beauty. It runs agilely as if on wings."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"昔から 多くの 人を 虜にした 美しい ポケモン。 飛ぶように 軽やかに 走る。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Son aboiement est tout simplement majestueux. On ne peut que ramper à ses pieds après l’avoir entendu."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Su magnífico ladrido transmite majestuosidad. Todo el que lo escuche no podrá evitar adularlo."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"Its magnificent bark conveys a sense of majesty. Anyone hearing it can’t help but grovel before it."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"堂々とした 鳴き声は 威厳に あふれ 聞いたものは 思わず ひれ伏してしまう。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Arcanin est célèbre pour son extraordinaire vitesse. On le dit capable de parcourir plus de 10 000 km en 24 h. Le feu qui fait rage à l’intérieur du corps de ce Pokémon est la source de son pouvoir."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Arcanine es conocido por lo veloz que es. Dicen que es capaz de correr 10 000 km en 24 horas. El fuego que arde con vigor en el interior de este Pokémon constituye su fuente de energía."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Arcanine is known for its high speed. It is said to be capable of running over 6,200 miles in a single day and night. The fire that blazes wildly within this Pokémon’s body is its source of power."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"１００００キロの 距離を 一昼夜で 走ると いわれている 快速の ポケモン。 体内で 燃え盛る 炎が パワーとなる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Arcanin est célèbre pour son extraordinaire vitesse. On le dit capable de parcourir plus de 10 000 km en 24 h. Le feu qui fait rage à l’intérieur du corps de ce Pokémon est la source de son pouvoir."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Arcanine es conocido por lo veloz que es. Dicen que es capaz de correr 10 000 km en 24 horas. El fuego que arde con vigor en el interior de este Pokémon constituye su fuente de energía."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Arcanine is known for its high speed. It is said to be capable of running over 6,200 miles in a single day and night. The fire that blazes wildly within this Pokémon’s body is its source of power."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"１００００キロの 距離を 一昼夜で 走ると いわれている 快速の ポケモン。 体内で 燃え盛る 炎が パワーとなる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sun","text":"Ce Pokémon apparaît dans de vieux contes d’Extrême-Orient. Aussi beau que majestueux, sa puissance est légendaire."},{"language":"es","version":"sun","text":"Aparece en algunas leyendas de la antigüedad. Es un Pokémon de una belleza y majestuosidad desmesuradas."},{"language":"en","version":"sun","text":"Overflowing with beauty and majesty, this strong Pokémon appears in ancient Eastern folklore."},{"language":"ja","version":"sun","text":"東洋の 古い 言い伝え にも 登場する。 威厳に あふれ たくましくも 美しい ポケモン。"},{"language":"fr","version":"moon","text":"La flamme qui brûle dans son corps lui donne l’énergie de parcourir les contrées. De nombreuses légendes existent à son sujet."},{"language":"es","version":"moon","text":"Puede recorrer grandes distancias gracias a la energía producida por el fuego de su interior. Hay innumerables leyendas sobre este Pokémon."},{"language":"en","version":"moon","text":"The fire burning inside its body serves as the energy to fuel it as it runs great distances. It appears in many legends."},{"language":"ja","version":"moon","text":"体内で 燃え盛る 炎を エネルギーに 大地を 駆ける。 多くの 伝説が 残っている。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Une légende célèbre relate les exploits d’un chef de guerre et de son Arcanin à la conquête d’un certain royaume antique."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Cuenta una antigua leyenda que, tiempo ha, llegó a conquistar territorios enteros luchando junto a cierto señor de la guerra."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Legends tell of its fighting alongside a general and conquering a whole country."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"大昔に とある 武将と ともに 戦い 国を 治めた という 伝説が 残されている。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Tant de mythes circulent sur son compte qu’il est parfois qualifié de légendaire, alors qu’en réalité, il est on ne peut plus commun."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"La infinidad de mitos relacionados con este Pokémon le ha conferido un carácter de leyenda, aunque en realidad es muy común."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"There are so many old tales about them that they’re called legendary Pokémon, but there are way more of them around than you’d expect."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"多くの 言い伝えが 残っており 伝説の ポケモンと 呼ばれるが 意外と 見つかる 数は 多い。"},{"language":"fr","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"Un Pokémon légendaire en Extrême-Orient. Il est admiré pour la grâce et la beauté de sa course."},{"language":"es","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"Este Pokémon es toda una leyenda en oriente. Muchos han quedado cautivados por la belleza y gracilidad que exhibe al correr."},{"language":"en","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"A legendary Pokémon in the East. Many people are charmed by the grace and beauty of its running."},{"language":"ja","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"東洋で 伝説の ポケモン。 軽やかに 走る その姿に 虜にされる 者も 多い。"},{"language":"fr","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"Un Pokémon légendaire en Extrême-Orient. Il est admiré pour la grâce et la beauté de sa course."},{"language":"es","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"Este Pokémon es toda una leyenda en oriente. Muchos han quedado cautivados por la belleza y gracilidad que exhibe al correr."},{"language":"en","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"A legendary Pokémon in the East. Many people are charmed by the grace and beauty of its running."},{"language":"ja","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"東洋で 伝説の ポケモン。 軽やかに 走る その姿に 虜にされる 者も 多い。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"De nombreuses personnes ont été charmées à la vue de ce Pokémon parcourant 10 000 km en 24 heures."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Es capaz de correr 10 000 km al día, lo que deja embelesados a todos los que lo ven pasar."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"The sight of it running over 6,200 miles in a single day and night has captivated many people."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"一昼夜で １００００キロの 距離を 駆けぬける 姿は 多くの 人を 魅了してきた。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Ce Pokémon est admiré depuis toujours pour sa beauté. Il court avec tellement de légèreté qu’on dirait qu’il vole."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Muchos han quedado cautivados por su belleza desde la antigüedad. Corre ágilmente como si tuviera alas."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"A Pokémon that has long been admired for its beauty. It runs agilely as if on wings."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"昔から 多くの 人を 虜にした 美しい ポケモン。 飛ぶように 軽やかに 走る。"},{"language":"en","version":"legends-arceus","text":"Snaps at its foes with fangs cloaked in blazing flame. Despite its bulk, it deftly feints every which way, leading opponents on a deceptively merry chase as it all but dances around them."}],"varieties":[{"id":59,"moves":[{"name":"headbutt","learns":[[3,"machine",0],[4,"machine",0],[10,"tutor",0],[19,"machine",0]]},{"name":"body-slam","learns":[[1,"machine",0],[2,"machine",0],[6,"tutor",0],[7,"tutor",0],[13,"tutor",0],[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0],[28,"machine",0],[29,"machine",0],[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"take-down","learns":[[1,"level-up",1],[1,"machine",0],[2,"level-up",1],[2,"machine",0],[3,"level-up",1],[4,"level-up",1],[20,"level-up",1],[23,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1],[25,"machine",0],[28,"level-up",1],[28,"machine",0],[29,"level-up",1],[29,"machine",0]]},{"name":"thrash","learns":[[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"double-edge","learns":[[1,"machine",0],[2,"machine",0],[6,"tutor",0],[7,"tutor",0],[13,"tutor",0],[19,"level-up",1],[25,"machine",0],[28,"machine",0],[29,"machine",0],[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"leer","learns":[[1,"level-up",1],[2,"level-up",1],[3,"level-up",1],[4,"level-up",1],[19,"level-up",1],[20,"level-up",1],[23,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1],[28,"level-up",1],[29,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"bite","learns":[[5,"level-up",1],[6,"level-up",1],[7,"level-up",1],[8,"level-u